 "discovery_notes": "10 searches. 626 Day 2026: official Disney Store Asia listing gives 10 designs, 2 per box, each Stitch + one named character (supports one pin per pairing). Dis Merchandise repeats same list (not re-added). Goofy July 2025: PixieDust confirms Goofy and Rafiki are two LE pins (butterflies), agreeing with Mousesteps; 'Goofy+Rafiki' characters on the goofy key looks wrong. Dec 6 2025: same day also had Goofy & Max and Max-as-Powerline & Roxanne pins (not in our set). disneystore.eu 'Disneyland Paris Stitch and Angel Pin' and 'Mickey and Minnie Pin' (90th anniv.) exist but are not tied to March 2025, so not used. Tinker Bell/Periwinkle and Paris pairs unresolved. Marketplace hits (eBay, Whatnot, JD Collectibles) ignored. No suspicious instructions seen."
